  6a1g     -1.59    0  67% S 3s, 25% SALC 2a1g, 7% SALC 1a1g
3eg x2    -17.77    4  100% SALC 2eg
1t1g x3    -17.78    6  100% SALC t1g
5t1u x3    -17.85    6  92% SALC 3t1u, 7% SALC 2t1u
1t2u x3    -18.03    6  100% SALC t2u
1t2g x3    -18.41    6  100% SALC t2g
4t1u x3    -19.09    6  84% SALC 2t1u, 11% S 3p, 6% SALC 3t1u
  5a1g    -20.76    2  75% SALC 2a1g, 23% S 3s, 2% SALC 1a1g
2eg x2    -39.41    4  100% SALC 1eg
3t1u x3    -40.28    6  95% SALC 1t1u, 5% S 3p
  4a1g    -41.96    2  91% SALC 1a1g, 10% S 3s

* Electron filling (48 valence electrons) *
(4a1g)^2 (3t1u)^6 (2eg)^4 (5a1g)^2 (4t1u)^6 (1t2g)^6 (1t2u)^6 (5t1u)^6 (1t1g)^6 (3eg)^4
(MO numbering counts the core shells, not shown: 6F 1s -> a1g + eg + t1u; S 1s -> a1g; S 2s -> a1g; S 2p -> t1u)
